{"id":"sobeslav","name":"Sobeslav","type":"character","aliases":[],"description":"A Golgari elf and assistant to Guildmaster Jarad who answers Mazirek's invitation and is killed by the kraul.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2017-05-31","last_seen":"2017-05-31","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Pride of the Kraul","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Alison Lührs"],"date":"2017-05-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Pride of the Kraul\" by Alison Lührs. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 May 2017."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"pride-kraul-2017-05-31-e0","era":null,"summary":"Sobeslav, Jarad's assistant, reads letters in the Guildhall and finds one from Mazirek of the kraul inviting Jarad.","participants":["sobeslav","mazirek","jarad"],"location":"svogthos","importance":"minor","page":"stories/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","order":608,"story_date":"2017-05-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":13,"quote":"From Mazirek of the kraul.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=From%20Mazirek%20of%20the%20kraul.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Pride of the Kraul","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Alison Lührs"],"date":"2017-05-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=From%20Mazirek%20of%20the%20kraul.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Pride of the Kraul\" by Alison Lührs. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 May 2017."}},{"id":"pride-kraul-2017-05-31-e1","era":null,"summary":"Sobeslav laughs and tosses the invitation in the rot pit, then decides to investigate and orders fifteen guards assembled.","participants":["sobeslav"],"location":"svogthos","importance":"minor","page":"stories/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","order":608,"story_date":"2017-05-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":22,"quote":"Assemble fifteen members of the guard,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=Assemble%20fifteen%20members%20of%20the%20guard%2C","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Pride of the Kraul","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Alison Lührs"],"date":"2017-05-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=Assemble%20fifteen%20members%20of%20the%20guard%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Pride of the Kraul\" by Alison Lührs. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 May 2017."}},{"id":"pride-kraul-2017-05-31-e2","era":null,"summary":"Sobeslav uses a spell on the mushroom to find the meeting place and leads the guards on a three-day descent below the Undercity.","participants":["sobeslav"],"location":"undercity","importance":"minor","page":"stories/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","order":608,"story_date":"2017-05-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":33,"quote":"On their third morning of journeying, Sobeslav called his guards to a halt.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=On%20their%20third%20morning,guards%20to%20a%20halt.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Pride of the Kraul","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Alison Lührs"],"date":"2017-05-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=On%20their%20third%20morning,guards%20to%20a%20halt.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Pride of the Kraul\" by Alison Lührs. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 May 2017."}},{"id":"pride-kraul-2017-05-31-e3","era":null,"summary":"Sobeslav and his guards squeeze through a crevice into a cavern with a carved slab and discover hundreds of kraul clinging to the ceiling.","participants":["sobeslav","kraul"],"location":"kraul-cavern","importance":"minor","page":"stories/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","order":608,"story_date":"2017-05-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":53,"quote":"There, clinging to the ceiling, waiting for their arrival, were the kraul.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=There%2C%20clinging%20to%20the,arrival%2C%20were%20the%20kraul.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Pride of the Kraul","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Alison Lührs"],"date":"2017-05-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=There%2C%20clinging%20to%20the,arrival%2C%20were%20the%20kraul.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Pride of the Kraul\" by Alison Lührs. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 May 2017."}},{"id":"pride-kraul-2017-05-31-e4","era":null,"summary":"Mazirek drops from the ceiling and mocks Sobeslav as Jarad's lapdog; the kraul laugh and begin killing the Golgari by mind-attack.","participants":["mazirek","sobeslav","kraul"],"location":"kraul-cavern","importance":"major","page":"stories/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","order":608,"story_date":"2017-05-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":56,"quote":"I invited Jarad vod Savo, and I received his lapdog instead.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=I%20invited%20Jarad%20vod,received%20his%20lapdog%20instead.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Pride of the Kraul","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Alison Lührs"],"date":"2017-05-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=I%20invited%20Jarad%20vod,received%20his%20lapdog%20instead.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Pride of the Kraul\" by Alison Lührs. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 May 2017."}},{"id":"pride-kraul-2017-05-31-e5","era":null,"summary":"Mazirek asks what the Golgari think of the kraul, and Sobeslav answers that they are laborers who must pay their dues.","participants":["mazirek","sobeslav"],"location":"kraul-cavern","importance":"minor","page":"stories/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","order":608,"story_date":"2017-05-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":63,"quote":"The kraul are . . . laborers. Workers.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=The%20kraul%20are%20.%20.%20.%20laborers.%20Workers.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Pride of the Kraul","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Alison Lührs"],"date":"2017-05-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=The%20kraul%20are%20.%20.%20.%20laborers.%20Workers.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Pride of the Kraul\" by Alison Lührs. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 May 2017."}},{"id":"pride-kraul-2017-05-31-e6","era":null,"summary":"Guards collapse one by one as Mazirek kills them with the kraul's laughter, one piece of brain at a time, saving Sobeslav for last.","participants":["mazirek","sobeslav","kraul"],"location":"kraul-cavern","importance":"major","page":"stories/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","order":608,"story_date":"2017-05-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":78,"quote":"I've been killing you and your guards for the last three minutes, one piece of your brain at a time.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=I%27ve%20been%20killing%20you,brain%20at%20a%20time.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Pride of the Kraul","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Alison Lührs"],"date":"2017-05-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=I%27ve%20been%20killing%20you,brain%20at%20a%20time.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Pride of the Kraul\" by Alison Lührs. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 May 2017."}},{"id":"pride-kraul-2017-05-31-e10","era":null,"summary":"The kraul chant as Mazirek harvests the souls of the dying guards and channels their power into his staff.","participants":["mazirek","kraul","sobeslav"],"location":"kraul-cavern","importance":"major","page":"stories/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","order":608,"story_date":"2017-05-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":101,"quote":"Mazirek reached out and caught the power that resonated with each deceased soul","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=Mazirek%20reached%20out%20and,with%20each%20deceased%20soul","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Pride of the Kraul","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Alison Lührs"],"date":"2017-05-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/pride-kraul-2017-05-31#:~:text=Mazirek%20reached%20out%20and,with%20each%20deceased%20soul","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Pride of the Kraul\" by Alison Lührs. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 May 2017."}},{"id":"pride-kraul-2017-05-31-e12","era":null,"summary":"The dying Sobeslav says a kraul cannot lead the Golgari, and Mazirek replies that he will not, but knows who will.","participant